{{!
    @template local_ai_course_assistant/analytics_tab_feedback

    AI Feedback tab of the analytics dashboard. Replaces the innerHTML string
    that amd/src/analytics_dashboard.js used to build for this pane
    (CONTRIB-10574 #278).

    This pane is the worst of the seven for injection: the negative-feedback
    table prints an excerpt of the AI reply alongside the learner's free-text
    comment. Both now go through Mustache escaping rather than a hand-rolled
    helper called at each concatenation point.

    The headings and column labels are still literal English, exactly as they
    were in the JavaScript this replaces.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cards - array of stat tiles, each with a value and a label
    * hasratings - true to show the thumbs up/down pie canvas
    * hasstars - true to show the star distribution canvas
    * hasnegatives - true when there is at least one negative rating to list
    * negatives - one entry per negative rating, each with excerpt, comment,
      hallucination and date

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cards": [
            {"value": "214", "label": "Thumbs up"},
            {"value": "9", "label": "Thumbs down"}
        ],
        "hasratings": true,
        "hasstars": true,
        "hasnegatives": true,
        "negatives": [
            {
                "excerpt": "Opportunity cost is the value of...",
                "comment": "This did not answer my question",
                "hallucination": "No",
                "date": "9/14/2026"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="sola-stat-cards">
    {{#cards}}
        <div class="sola-stat-card">
            <div class="sola-stat-value">{{value}}</div>
            <div class="sola-stat-label">{{label}}</div>
        </div>
    {{/cards}}
</div>
<div class="row mt-4">
    {{#hasratings}}
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <h5>Message Ratings</h5>
            <canvas id="sola-chart-msgratings" height="200"></canvas>
        </div>
    {{/hasratings}}
    {{#hasstars}}
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <h5>Star Rating Distribution</h5>
            <canvas id="sola-chart-stars" height="200"></canvas>
        </div>
    {{/hasstars}}
</div>
{{#hasnegatives}}
    <h5 class="mt-4">Recent Negative Feedback</h5>
    <table class="table table-sm table-striped">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Message Excerpt</th>
                <th>Comment</th>
                <th>Hallucination?</th>
                <th>Date</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {{#negatives}}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{excerpt}}</td>
                    <td>{{comment}}</td>
                    <td>{{hallucination}}</td>
                    <td>{{date}}</td>
                </tr>
            {{/negatives}}
        </tbody>
    </table>
{{/hasnegatives}}
